{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":232,"count":23,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-10\",\"山\",\"山\",\"山\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你喜歡山上的風景還是海邊的風景？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān shānshàng de fēngjǐng háishì hǎibiān de fēngjǐng?","english":"Do you like the scenery on the mountain or on the beach?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-11","sourceFront":"風景","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"a 凵(container) holds one tall peak between two lower ridges → the rocky 山(mountain)."},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-34\",\"类\",\"類\",\"类\",\"M/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這一類的中文小說都放在圖書館的二樓。","pinyin":"Zhè yī lèi de Zhōngwén xiǎoshuō dōu fàng zài túshūguǎn de èr lóu.","english":"Chinese novels of this category are all placed on the second floor of the library.","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-34","sourceFront":"類","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"人類的智慧表現在思考、溝通、欣賞、創造等方面。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-04","sourceFront":"智慧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像機場、高鐵、捷運這類公共交通建設，都需要很多經費才能完成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-21","sourceFront":"建設","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"科學家發明了電燈，改變了人類的生活方式，也大大提高了生活品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-20","sourceFront":"發明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像食物銀行、愛心冰箱此類處理食物的做法，不但可以節省資源，還能幫助需要的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-05","sourceFront":"此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"由於雲端科技的進步，人類的生活方式跟以往比起來有很大的差異。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-07","sourceFront":"由於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類過度的發展活動，已對動植物的生活環境造成嚴重破壞。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-23","sourceFront":"過度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家超市蔬菜水果的種類很多，可提供民眾較多的選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-15","sourceFront":"種類","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家文具店賣的文具種類很多，像筆、書包、本子等學生用品，不僅品質好，價錢也不貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-16","sourceFront":"文具","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在地理條件好的地區，不但農產品種類較多，價格也便宜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-06","sourceFront":"農產品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"會議資料的分類不必太仔細，分得簡單清楚就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-20","sourceFront":"分類","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類破壞了自然，就是破壞了自己的生活環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-30","sourceFront":"自然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類活動產生許多垃圾，不但汙染了環境，更改變了全球氣候。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-45","sourceFront":"汙染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類大腦分成幾區，有的管語言，有的管記憶，很有意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-23","sourceFront":"大腦","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據手術的種類，病人在動手術前能吃的食物也不太相同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-05","sourceFront":"手術","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這桌喜酒有很多海鮮，但我只能吃魚，其他種類的海鮮都會讓我皮膚紅腫(inflamed)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-48","sourceFront":"海鮮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"用人類的角度去看大自然， 就看不出大自然的本來價值。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-11","sourceFront":"本來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"奶油不但種類多，並且是做甜點時不能少的材料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-17","sourceFront":"奶油","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-1-14\",\"誇張\",\"誇張\",\"夸张\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你說你昨天吃了五盤芒果冰，太誇張了吧！","pinyin":"Nǐ shuō nǐ zuótiān chīle wǔ pán mángguǒ bīng, tài kuāzhāng le ba!","english":"You say you ate five plates of mango shaved ice yesterday—that's too exaggerated!","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-14","sourceFront":"誇張","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"就我對小林的了解，他是一個很實在的人，不但做事認真，說話也不誇張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-09","sourceFront":"就","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個女演員演戲的樣子很自然，一點也不誇張，難怪導演很欣賞她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-12","sourceFront":"自然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個店員的工作態度很隨便，常弄錯商品的價格，還找錯錢， 真是太誇張了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-08","sourceFront":"隨便","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"客人都抵達婚禮現場了，新娘卻還沒開始化妝，太誇張了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-04","sourceFront":"新娘","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個背包在設計上沒什麼特色，只是印了某位明星隨手畫的圖，沒想到就要賣上萬元，實在有點兒誇張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-30","sourceFront":"印","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次會議的效率真差，有人竟然沒看資料就來了，真是誇張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-15","sourceFront":"竟然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-1-12\",\"禮貌\",\"禮貌\",\"礼貌\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"搭公車時，年輕人應該把位子給老人坐，這是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"Dā gōngchē shí, niánqīngrén yīnggāi bǎ wèizi gěi lǎorén zuò, zhè shì yì zhǒng lǐmào.","english":"When taking the bus, young people should give their seats to the elderly; this is a kind of politeness.","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-12","sourceFront":"禮貌","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個學生很有禮貌，一看見老師就說：「老師好！」","pinyin":"Nàge xuéshēng hěn yǒu lǐmào, yí kàn jiàn lǎoshī jiù shuō: “Lǎoshī hǎo!”","english":"That student is very polite; as soon as he sees the teacher, he says, \"Hello, teacher!\"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-13","sourceFront":"有禮貌","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"小簡是一個有愛心、有禮貌的人，像這樣子的男人你要好好把握啊！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-14","sourceFront":"這樣子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小高總是在別人面前表現得很有禮貌，不過回到家就完全變了一個樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-11","sourceFront":"面前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他雖然年紀小，但是對人有禮貌，也很體貼父母，是個乖孩子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-08","sourceFront":"乖","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"進辦公室前，別忘了摘下帽子，這是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-23","sourceFront":"摘","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對爺爺來說，所謂的「好孩子」，就是很孝順、有禮貌、功課好的孩子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-07","sourceFront":"所謂","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"去朋友家以前，一定要約好時間才去，這是做人的基本禮貌","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-22","sourceFront":"基本","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孔子認為對人有禮貌、尊敬老師、孝順父母，是做人的基本。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-22","sourceFront":"基本","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"收到別人的信時，應該回信告訴對方收到了，這是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-23","sourceFront":"回信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你最好別穿著拖鞋去參加正式活動，要不然別人可能認為你不懂禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-29","sourceFront":"拖鞋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"跟別人握手時，握得太久或太緊都是沒有禮貌的行為。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-12","sourceFront":"握手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"妳去面試時稍微化妝一下，是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-40","sourceFront":"稍微","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在華人社會中，見面時晚輩先問候長輩是應有的禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-17","sourceFront":"晚輩","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然他已經親自說了對不起，但還是很後悔做出那樣沒禮貌的行為，於是再度向各位道歉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-05","sourceFront":"再度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-2-06\",\"名\",\"名\",\"名\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他叫什麼名字？你知道嗎？","pinyin":"Tā jiào shénme míngzi? Nǐ zhīdào ma?","english":"What is his name? Do you know?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-02","sourceFront":"名字","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"是啊，因為這個牌子很有名，衣服、褲子和裙子也都很好看，所以很多人買。","pinyin":"Shì a, yīnwèi zhè ge páizi hěn yǒumíng, yīfu, kùzi hé qúnzi yě dōu hěn hǎokàn, suǒyǐ hěn duō rén mǎi.","english":"Yes, it is. This brand is very famous and its tops, pants and skirts are very beautiful, so many people buy it.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"妳好！我是李中明，請問妳叫什麼名字？","pinyin":"Nǐ hǎo! Wǒ shì Lǐ Zhōngmíng, qǐngwèn nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?","english":"Hi, my name is Li Zhongming. May I ask what your name is?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-01","sourceFront":"什麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"In the 夕(evening) light, a 口(mouth) calls out a 名(name)."},{"key":"[\"B3L02-1-08\",\"空間\",\"空間\",\"空间\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們學校的禮堂看起來空間不大，其實坐得下一千人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-08","sourceFront":"空間","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那兩家便利商店同樣提供客人休息的座位，但是第二家的空間比第一家大多了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-24","sourceFront":"同樣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家動物餐廳的空間很大，可以讓客人的小動物自由自在地活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-43","sourceFront":"自由自在","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那部電影沒有結局，是導演要留給觀眾想像的空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-32","sourceFront":"結局","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只有圖畫，沒有文字的故事書 ，能夠留給兒童想像及思考的空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-10","sourceFront":"圖畫","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了提高這座城市的文化水準，市長積極建設藝術表演中心、圖書館等公共空間","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-21","sourceFront":"建設","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然新租的房子空間不大，環境倒挺乾淨的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-54","sourceFront":"倒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我想在床旁邊擺個書桌，不過空間不太夠，你可以幫我把床移到牆邊嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-28","sourceFront":"移","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳說月亮上住著一隻兔子，這個神話留給孩子們許多想像空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-04","sourceFront":"傳說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這棟房子空間小，位置離市區又遠，所以價值三百萬而已。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-24","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 空(empty) and 間(between): 空間 means space."},{"key":"[\"B3L05-1-25\",\"糟\",\"糟\",\"糟\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"糟了！衣服被咖啡弄髒了，我得換一件才能出門。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-25","sourceFront":"糟","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這次的水災不僅淹了整條街，好幾家工廠也因為淹水沒辦法生產，真是太糟了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-29","sourceFront":"水災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個地區被颱風破壞得相當嚴重，不是樹木倒了，就是屋頂被吹走了，情況非常糟糕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-24","sourceFront":"糟糕","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"醫生一再警告韓先生絕對不能再喝酒了，要不然他的身體情況就會更糟了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-21","sourceFront":"一再","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"方老師非常有耐心，就算學生考試的成績很糟，也從來沒發過脾氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-10","sourceFront":"發脾氣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:糟了，我不小心把隨身碟弄丟了，資料都存在裡面。 B:這下子我們的期末報告都白做了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這部電影的字幕翻譯得很糟糕，讓人弄不清楚它的意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-23","sourceFront":"字幕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他現在的身體狀況很糟，請暫時先別去探他的病。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-01","sourceFront":"探病","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我好友昨天和女朋友分手了，這幾天心情很糟，我得去安慰安慰他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-10","sourceFront":"分手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"When 米(rice) is served by 曹(officials), the meal turns 糟(bad)."},{"key":"[\"B3L07-2-19\",\"专心\",\"專心\",\"专心\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"林同學上課很專心，也很認真地把老師教的寫下來，這樣回家就能複習了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-19","sourceFront":"專心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那所學校規定學生不能帶手機上學，是希望他們專心學習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-24","sourceFront":"規定","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開會前經理要求大家勿開手機，專心討論會議內容。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-10","sourceFront":"勿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-16\",\"老家\",\"老家\",\"老家\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"王老先生年輕時就離開了家鄉，他很想回老家去看看親人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-29","sourceFront":"家鄉","sourceBookI