ank":2},{"chinese":"一個國家光是依靠免費簽證，是無法吸引國外遊客來旅行的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-32","sourceFront":"光是","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"台灣有句著名的廣告台詞「心動不如馬上行動」，意思是當個人有了想法之後，光是想是沒用的，得立刻行動才行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-34","sourceFront":"行動","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"假如缺乏陽光、空氣和水這三項條件，植物就無法生長。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-10","sourceFront":"生長","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在冬天，臺灣南部比北部暖和，你可以到南部享受暖暖的陽光。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-49","sourceFront":"暖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他愛亂花錢，三天下來，就把一個月的生活費花光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-02","sourceFront":"下來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"元宵節時公園裡點起各式各樣的燈籠，各種顏色的燈光漂亮極了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-17","sourceFront":"燈光","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"王先生投資生意的眼光很好，讓他僅僅一年就買下了好幾棟大樓。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-03","sourceFront":"投資","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"每個民族都有自己獨特的習俗，像華人除夕貼春聯、年夜飯的魚不能吃光就很特別。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-33","sourceFront":"習俗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我父母每個月初寄錢給我，但我總是在月中就把錢花光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-25","sourceFront":"初","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那場演唱會請到了大家最喜愛的明星，所以門票很快就被搶光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-41","sourceFront":"搶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"強烈的陽光對我們的眼睛不好，出門活動時最好戴上太陽眼鏡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-03","sourceFront":"強烈","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"包小姐的眼光很好，一看就知道那件黃色外套的品質最好","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-20","sourceFront":"眼光","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"妹妹：我希望將來找個又聰明又有錢 ，而且很體貼我的男朋友。 姊姊：妳的眼光太高了，恐怕找不到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-20","sourceFront":"眼光","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"剩下的飯菜加熱太多次，就沒什麼營養了，最好每餐都吃光。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-21","sourceFront":"加熱","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"週末到花蓮的火車票一下子就賣光了。","pinyin":"Zhōumò dào Huālián de huǒchēpiào yīxiàzi jiù mài guāng le.","english":"Weekend train tickets to Hualien sold out in an instant.","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-19","sourceFront":"光","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這種巧克力是情人節最熱門的商品，總是一下子就賣光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-06","sourceFront":"熱門","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市夜晚因各種各樣的彩色燈光，而使得景色既浪漫又迷人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-18","sourceFront":"景色","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"白天沙漠裡的沙子很燙(to be scalded)，要是光著腳，一定會被燙傷的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-27","sourceFront":"沙子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我去英國留學時，常利用週末到旅行社打工，帶觀光客到著名的景點觀光。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-31","sourceFront":"觀光客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"觀光客都說日本四季的景色都很有特色，有機會我要親自去體驗一下。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-32","sourceFront":"體驗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每天光說夢想，一點兒用都沒有，還是努力實現比較實在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-42","sourceFront":"實現","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些國家為了吸引更多的觀光客來旅遊，就把一些出境、入境的手續改簡單了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-59","sourceFront":"有些","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在天氣好的夜晚，星光看起來更加浪漫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-11","sourceFront":"星光","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"本地社區的房子常被好奇的觀光客破壞，令人們十分不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-09","sourceFront":"好奇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"花蓮太魯閣的確很漂亮，難怪每年都吸引許多觀光客去參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-15","sourceFront":"的確","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些國家的傳統戲劇常利用影子和燈光效果來表演。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-19","sourceFront":"影子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天光是整理前院的花草樹木就讓我累得要命，只好明天再整理後院了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-44","sourceFront":"要命","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"最近賣的新飲料很有特色，所以光臨我們店的客人越來越多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-25","sourceFront":"光臨","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"錢小姐戴的那副耳環就像星光一樣美麗，聽說那是祖母留給她的回憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-41","sourceFront":"耳環","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些事情光是勤勞沒有用，得用對方法才行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-37","sourceFront":"勤勞","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了發展工業而不斷開發，這樣下去森林早晚會被破壞光的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-10","sourceFront":"早晚","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他勸我別太在意別人的眼光，把自己負責的事完成就好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-10","sourceFront":"勸","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在戶外的夜景中攝影，以月光當作背景可增加神秘的感覺。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-24","sourceFront":"月光","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"c