n":"Wǒmen qù pǎobù, zěnmeyàng?","english":"How about we go running then?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我不喜歡跑步，我跑步跑得很慢。","pinyin":"Wǒ bù xǐhuān pǎobù, wǒ pǎobù pǎo de hěn màn.","english":"I do not like to run; I run slowly.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 止(stop) rests over a 𣥂(footprint) → measured strides: 步(step)."},{"key":"[\"B4L11-2-01\",\"罷了\",\"罷了\",\"罢了\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他贏了這次選舉只是運氣好罷了，其實他沒什麼能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-01","sourceFront":"罷了","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-13\",\"火腿\",\"火腿\",\"火腿\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"火腿裡放了很多鹽巴，醫師不建議爺爺多吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-13","sourceFront":"火腿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-19\",\"向来\",\"向來\",\"向来\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他對發展新科技向來保守，不願接受人工智慧產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-19","sourceFront":"向來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-36\",\"奖金\",\"獎金\",\"奖金\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為了吸引人才，廣告企業提供獎金給優秀的設計師。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-36","sourceFront":"獎金","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"世界上\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"世(world) + 界(boundary) = world; 上(on) → on the world, meaning in the world."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"主要\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 主(master) and 要(essential): 主要 means mainly."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"生日\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"生(birth) + 日(day) → the day of your birth: 生日(birthday)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"當作\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 當(appropriate) and 作(make): 當作 means treat as."}]}
